Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：特隆发誓要复仇的对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同时也是 快斗和哈鲁特的父亲 Dr.菲卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的目的就是与异晶界联手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为这个世界的支配者！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此竟然让快斗去收集
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡 绝对不能原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让那些自私的大人们好好吃我一记{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以决斗冠军为目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火力全开 上啊 我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗嘉年华也进入半决赛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)热血决斗者们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗的场地 就是这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 决斗塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)在这座贯穿天空的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战士们 尽情地战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)游马的对手是鲨鱼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)这对游马君来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定还稍微有点有利哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和鲨鱼已经交战过好多次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底应该已经摸清他的底细了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但对方也一样乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 要说游马连对手的底细
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都记得住 那不太可能乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小猫)喵什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底站哪边的喵 德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《小鸟：确实 游马是交战过好多次没错{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 鲨鱼在和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出的那只怪兽》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((凌牙：为了完成复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会接受一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 海咬龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我的愿望 进化吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙·拜斯！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 终于到了半决赛第一回合的比赛开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.17,0:02:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大会前几乎还是无名之辈{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一路走到这里历经无数激战脱颖而出{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇迹般地闯入决赛圈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功晋级的 奇迹男孩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢谢谢 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.05,0:02:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与之相对的是因丑闻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被逐出决斗界 从谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今再度雄壮复活{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇者！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天一定要和你做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点不对劲啊 鲨鱼那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 到底怎么了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 两位勇者啊。现在 登上决战的舞台！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从现在起 能前往上层场地的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有赢下半决赛的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.83,0:03:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 能在决赛中存活下来的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马吗！？还是凌牙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻 战斗的帷幕即将拉开！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心跳 燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么了啊 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光界)难道说 被 No.的黑暗给…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在与{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的对战中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼突然 得到了 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那成为可能的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是将他 完全支配的 No.的黑暗之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(托隆)会让我们看到怎样的战斗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是无比期待呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 不过哪边会赢早就 已经定好了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}振作点 鲨鱼！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果他 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被 No.给吞噬了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那战斗的本能应该被磨砺得更加敏锐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙只能用决斗来对话了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标 锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 链接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.49,0:06:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放一张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错以里侧守备表示设置的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力1900的 躲躲炸弹。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一张盖牌是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 攻击无敌化。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 这样一来 大概率
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该能扛住攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上啊 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 尖刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1600！ 这样的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼居然 这么简单的决斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用尖刺鲨 攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然毫无警戒地攻击多多多木偶！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 竟然毫无警戒地攻过来……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 是怎么了\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贸然发动攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反而让自己受到了伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的鲨鱼 我从没见过。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗水平还烂得不行时候的游马呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)不…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这或许是他的作战。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼是认为游马君正在研究自己{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以才用和以往不同的模式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始决斗的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那受到伤害也是故意的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…换作平时的话战斗的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该会频频传达过来才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在他的心中 到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 千万别放松警惕。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张盖牌 要小心。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再把 怒怒怒机器人转为攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击尖鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没恢复清醒吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 怒怒怒机器人！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雷霆之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)这招好猛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气就受到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高达1800点的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟能否站起来 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}像平时那样冲我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！鲨鱼！鲨鱼！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个鲨鱼 居然这么轻易就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么啊 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 不是一直都
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着像要咬住对手一样的气势 冲上来的吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以才叫鲨鱼的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不战斗的鲨鱼 就不是鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.60,0:10:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 轮到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 站起来！站起来啊 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 我是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了决斗 才在这里的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么要战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到底是为了什么在战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想不起来。为什么？ 怎么会…》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)忘掉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还记得我呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 你的自我半吊子地残留下来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能毫不犹豫地决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？ 你 为什么要战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然 是为了我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了你？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要 为了我而战斗。作为我的人偶呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 该打倒的对手是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 该打倒的对手…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～呀，这是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙突然痛苦起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)真没办法啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该打倒的对手还没想起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}昨天明明好好告诉过你了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。那么我再告诉你一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你该打倒的对手是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我该打倒的对手是特隆…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？这家伙是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)是菲卡博士。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)菲卡？菲卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这名字好像在哪里听过…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Dr.菲卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会对这个名字有印象，也是理所当然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你一直～都在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追着那家伙跑嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让妹妹遭遇了那么惨的事对Dr.菲卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你曾在心里发誓要复仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.09,0:13:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让璃绪遭遇那种事的就是Dr.菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真正的敌人是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是Dr.菲卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有另一个人对吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个碍你事的碍眼家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个人……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)没错。你一直
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直觉得这家伙碍眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你做的事他总是来捣乱的那个他……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙现在就在眼前。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和Dr.费卡联手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你妹妹遭遇了惨事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那另一半 就在那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我饶不了你 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:14:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是你……都是因为你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆也有同样的纹章。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附身在鲨鱼身上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是 No.卡 而是特隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 也可以这么说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}准确来说是我忠实的仆从 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过已经和他一体化了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.89,0:15:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙完全是我的东西可爱的提线木偶。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 动手吧把九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合！ 抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 双头鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水之喷射！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到回合结束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨的攻击力上升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击隆隆隆石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:15:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守住！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 攻击无敌化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.39,0:16:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这个效果隆隆隆石人不会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.66,0:16:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！ 我从手牌发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.77,0:16:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼火花！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效对方的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续攻击！双头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合可以攻击两次。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击多嘴多舌鹦鹉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一度以为就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要输掉的凌牙一转攻势猛烈反击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下大家的内心也……燃烧起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然像变了个人似的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那副样子到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在装乖的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不想被那种家伙装……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么乌拉……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再从手牌发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死亡清扫！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要唤回的是刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}替妹妹报仇雪恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然认真的鲨鱼就是厉害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，是超越了认真。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的他正受到托隆的支配。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，他一定发挥出了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}远超平时的强大力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆的支配……而且那家伙现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((绝不原谅你，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}替妹妹报仇雪恨！))
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难、难道说 那家伙难道说特隆那家伙竟然把记忆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 就像你在和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的决斗中被干掉那样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼恐怕也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双头鲨的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气葬送对方两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是我看中的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话 作为派去对付Dr.费卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刺客 再合适不过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都想把鲨鱼从特隆手中救出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 该怎么做才好…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不光是特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的心里还有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那东西还会进化成 CNo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·德雷克·拜斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在解开特隆的咒缚之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果鲨鱼召唤出 No.怪兽的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 只要赢了就行了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢下来 让鲨鱼清醒过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 游马！ 游马！ 游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！游马！游马！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥哥哥哥斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！哥哥哥哥斯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击尖刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！宙斯之祝福！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:20:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡将对方怪兽的攻击无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方800点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种陷阱……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然鲨鱼好帅啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来游马君的生命值就是1800了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.87,0:20:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是鲨鱼也只有1700哦……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负现在才要开始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经没有打倒我的办法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妹妹的仇，现在就让我来报。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是我！ 清醒点鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害你妹妹的是特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧。求饶的话还另说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今还想狡辩……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里把你送进地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我和我的 No.们！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。鲨鱼的场上有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经有2只等级4的怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤鲨鱼帕斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的尖吻鲨和双头鲨{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后与鲨鱼帕斯这3只进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙终于…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不错，非常不错啊凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，把碍眼的九十九游马给埋葬掉吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.31,0:24:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，终于要和鲨鱼对战了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.13,0:24:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和鲨鱼是1胜1败1平，五五开！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.34,0:24:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也到底哪边会赢，还真不好说。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.69,0:24:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟这可是马对鲨鱼的战斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.55,0:24:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那里吗！

